# Code Verification ANSYS — README

Purpose
- Verification data files from ANSYS (control vs no-control) used to validate the simulation workflow and compare results.

Key files
- [Code Verification ANSYS/Output_DataAmplitude_NoControl.txt](Code Verification ANSYS/Output_DataAmplitude_NoControl.txt)
- [Code Verification ANSYS/Output_DataAmplitude_Control.txt](Code Verification ANSYS/Output_DataAmplitude_Control.txt)
- (Other Output_* files in this folder)

Usage
- Load these text files in MATLAB (e.g., `fscanf` or `readmatrix`) to reproduce verification plots in `Code Results/result_harmonic_analysis.m`.